WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.600
Zero-shot multi-task reinforcement learning, at scale.
Deliver a crate to green and a vase to red.

00:05.600 --> 00:08.000
Complex tasks, expressed in temporal logic:
visit green and yellow repeatedly, and purple at least once.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.300
Compile the formal instruction into an automaton.

00:12.300 --> 00:19.000
Then execute: the agent navigates between coloured zones.

00:19.000 --> 00:23.000
Faster with JAX: accelerate learning and evaluation.

00:23.000 --> 00:28.300
Scale up to many parallel environments:
navigation, object delivery, and robot control.

00:28.300 --> 00:33.000
Jaxolotl. Multi-task RL with formal instructions. Powered by JAX.
github.com/mathiasj33/jaxolotl · arxiv.org/abs/2609.38065
